  - Fractions: `$\frac{a}{b}$`
  - Roots: `$\sqrt{x}$`, `$\sqrt[n]{x}$`
  - Exponents & Subscripts: `$x_1^2$`, `$v_0$`
  - Greek Letters: `$\pi, \theta, \alpha, \beta, \Delta, \lambda, \mu, \omega, \Sigma, \Omega$`
